@title Crane in 3D: slack rope of a closed-loop winch lies in a heap beside the block
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# The closed-loop fixture has the ground 0.3 m below the hook start. Holding the down button lands the hook and
# the drum pays out rope; Hoist in 3D then shows the loose rope as a heap on the floor next to the block, and the
# line under the controls gives the slack rope in mm.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch-ground.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 20
key Home
wait 30
mouse_down 371 440
wait 2300
mouse_up 371 440
wait 600
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 60
shot slack-heap-in-the-picture
expect "slack rope"
expect "Picture, not measurement"
check_layout
